        "thread_id": "TH2",
        "thread_goal": "Design and finalise the training modules and wellbeing protocol.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M19",
            "speaker_id": 45680,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi all, following up on T3, I've drafted three potential communication modules based on the stressor analysis. They are: 1. Active Listening Under Pressure, 2. De-escalating with Empathy, and 3. Setting Boundaries Politely. What are your thoughts? I'm aiming to create a simple job aid, A3, for the key takeaways.",
            "mentions": [
              56723,
              4784,
              605
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T3",
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M20",
            "speaker_id": 89425,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "Those topics look great, @45680. On the wellbeing side (T4), I've drafted a protocol for desk-based micro-breaks in A4. It includes 6 simple, low-impact stretches focusing on the neck, shoulders, and back, plus a breathing exercise. Everything is designed to be done safely at a desk with no equipment. I've included notes on contraindications to ensure it's inclusive.",
            "mentions": [
              45680
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T4",
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "muscle",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M21",
            "speaker_id": 4784,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "The communication topics seem right. De-escalation is definitely a big need for my team.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M22",
            "speaker_id": 56723,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "This is good. For the 'Setting Boundaries' module, we should double-check that the advice aligns with our official customer service policies. I can review the content once it's drafted.",
            "mentions": [
              45680
