            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M23",
            "speaker_id": 605,
            "reply_to": "M20",
            "text": "Thanks @89425, I've looked at A4. For the neck stretch, does it matter if you pull your head with your hand? I've seen people do that.",
