            "speaker_id": 89425,
            "reply_to": "M55",
            "text": "Thanks @56723. I've reviewed A7 and A8. On the compliance front, we should add a line to the participant comms about the physical activities being voluntary and that individuals should only participate to their own comfort level. It's a small but important point for liability.",
