            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M58",
            "speaker_id": 605,
            "reply_to": "M55",
            "text": "I've read the governance doc A8. It suggests a quarterly review committee. Is that too frequent? Maybe semi-annually would be better? I also found a template for a program charter we could use, it's a bit more detailed.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M59",
            "speaker_id": 45680,
            "reply_to": "M58",
            "text": "A full charter might be overkill for this. Let's keep it simple. I think the core of the governance in A8 is about ownership. I'd propose: HR (@56723) owns the overall program and policy alignment (T11). Supervisors (me and @4784) own the delivery, scheduling, and running the wellbeing check-ins (T12). Admin (@605) owns the documentation and tracking (T10). A quick check-in every six months sounds right.",
            "mentions": [
              605,
              56723,
              4784
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A8",
              "T10",
              "T11",
              "T12"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "heavy_check_mark",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M60",
            "speaker_id": 56723,
            "reply_to": "M59",
            "text": "That simplified ownership structure is much clearer. I'm happy with that. So we agree on those roles and a semi-annual review cadence?",
            "mentions": [
              45680
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D8"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M61",
            "speaker_id": 605,
            "reply_to": "M59",
            "text": "Ok, that makes sense. Simpler is better. I'll update A8 to reflect that ownership model.",
            "mentions": [
